dialect protocol
protocol s.stdio.semio.graph.diff
version 1
schema s.stdio.semio.graph
start body
framing record

# UNIFIED-COMPOSABLE-ARTIFACT-SYSTEM graph wave: real binary diff frame. `format u8` + `presence
# u8` (bit0=`nodes`, bit1=`edges`) are two REAL fixed fields; when present, each list follows as a
# real varint count + per-record repeated data — modeled as one opaque trailing `payload` chain
# (the `protocol-array-of-records` gap every sibling subset's own diff protocol uses at this
# boundary). The real Rust `encode_diff`/`decode_diff` (`../../🦀️component.rs`) stays genuinely,
# fully structured — round-trip tested independently.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field presence u8

chain payload bytes
